{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach and take it. Analyze object properties, move to destination. Scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Action ID = AnalyzeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = AnalyzeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />\"",
